@startuml
hide footbox
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ParticipantPadding 24
skinparam BoxPadding 12
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 100
title S04-ddd-sequence — source snapshot (not a runtime trace)
participant "obj: 调用者" as obj
participant "filter: CourseProxyFilter" as filter
participant "route: RouteRegistry" as route
participant "tokens: TokenProvider" as tokens
participant "auth: AuthorizationApplicationService" as auth
participant "body: BoundedBody" as body
participant "proxy: ProxyClient" as proxy
activate obj
obj -> filter: 1. doFilter(request, response, chain)
activate filter
note over obj,filter
Course web Nginx forwards protected /api/ routes to rbac-backend.
The filter is registered when course.upstream is configured.
Center /api/v1 routes continue through the normal filter chain.
end note
filter -> route: 2. resolve(request.method, path without /api)
activate route
route --> filter: operationId
deactivate route
alt route and Bearer header accepted
group configured Authorize callback in rbac-backend
filter -> tokens: 3. verify(token)
activate tokens
deactivate tokens
alt verified token with course audience
filter -> auth: 4. validate(principal)
activate auth
auth --> filter: actor
deactivate auth
filter -> auth: 5. api(actorId, systemCode, operationId)
activate auth
auth --> filter: allowed
deactivate auth
ref over filter,auth: S04-ddd-policy-sequence shows the version bracket
else invalid token or audience
filter --> obj: 401 / 403
end
end
alt authorization accepted
filter -> body: 6. read(request input, max request bytes, 413)
activate body
body --> filter: bytes
deactivate body
alt body read succeeds
filter -> proxy: 7. forward(request, coursePath, bytes, traceId, false)
activate proxy
proxy --> filter: course response
deactivate proxy
note over proxy
HTTP to course-backend; relay its response.
Course object-level 403 is preserved.
end note
filter --> obj: course response
else body error
filter --> obj: 400 / 413
end
else denied or unavailable
filter --> obj: 403 / 503
end
else invalid route or Bearer header
filter --> obj: 400 / 404 / 401
end
deactivate filter
deactivate obj
@enduml